          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            The concept of
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/solid+topos"} solid topos
            is meant to be a characterization of
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/gros+toposes"} gros toposes
            which further refines that of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/elastic+toposes"} elastic toposes
            and
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cohesive+toposes"} cohesive toposes
